.env
.env.*
.venv
.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
*.db
*.db-*
tests

# Never build credentials or key material into the API image. Measured 2026-11-15: the deploy's
# private key had been copied to api/app/Concierge and shipped in the running image, world
# readable inside the container — any code execution in the API would have handed over root on
# the host. The key file was removed from the release tree and the image rebuilt.
Concierge
Concierge.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
.env*
